Key Findings About Kaspa Testnet 12 (TN12)
Testnet 12 Features
The covenant code you're looking at is part of KIP-17 (Kaspa Improvement Proposal 17), which includes:

Covenant IDs for protocol-level transaction constraints
Blake3 sequencing commitments for transaction ordering
On-chain zero-knowledge verification (KIP-16) supporting Groth16 and RISC0
L1 programmability enhancements
