The Code Pattern You Showed
The test_state_transition_with_spk_verification() test you shared demonstrates:

CovenantBinding - linking outputs to covenant rules
EngineFlags with covenants_enabled: true - enabling covenant verification
CovenantsContext - managing covenant state and transitions
State verification - ensuring output scripts match expected patterns
This is part of the Silverscript SDK's covenant builder pattern, which is the primary way to write and test TN12 covenants.

